10086633,2024-09-11,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I have the following inquiries that I didnt consent to nor for I benefit from. XXXX XX/XX/XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX 15 U.S. Code 1681b - Permissible purposes of consumer reports I am asking all credit bureaus to stop reporting on my consumer reports. It is causing me pain and suffering. I have a right to privacy according to the Privacy act of 1974.

